    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "IMO the argument `undefined` is useless and might be even counter-intuitive. Here, the intent is to omit the value on the `SearchParameters` which is what the call translate. With the value `undefined` we might expect that the final object will actually contain `undefined` which is not the case. I'm fine with both solution though, if you both agree that it's better I'll update.",
